  "title": "PR Lens workflow: provider temperature + architecture-lens fallback",
  "summary": "The PR Lens GitHub Actions workflow is updated to run CLI 0.13.0, to pass an explicit temperature per provider (the OpenAI default is a reasoning model that rejects a fixed temperature, so its row asks for the provider default), and to make each provider attempt more resilient: a provider is first tried with both lenses, then retried with the architecture lens alone, and only then does the workflow fall through to the second provider. The provider table gains a fifth column, the attempt helper gains a temperature argument and pass-through extra flags, and the retry bookkeeping now accumulates reasons across both lens attempts.",
  "lenses": [
    "architecture",
    "data-flow"
  ],
